They also say that there is a big difference between "seems" and
"is".  If you get the message "This wall is too hard to dig into"
you are trying to dig into an area NetHack doesn't know about, i.e.,
one of the boundaries on the level imposed by nethack is where you
are trying to dig.  The upshot is, you'll never break through, so stop
digging there.  If you get the message "This wall seems to hard
to dig into" keep digging, eventually you'll break through.


